WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Solve by reversing the order of operations: undo addition or subtraction first, then multiplication or division.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000
In 2x + 4 = 14, subtract 4 from both sides to get 2x = 10. Divide both sides by 2 to get x = 5.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Check by substitution: 2 × 5 + 4 = 14. Watch the video, then try the exercise in the handout.
